{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>8月中推出!外層香脆鹹香惹味</p><p>九龍香格里拉酒店推出巨型明太子法包</p><p>九龍香格里拉酒店將福岡博多的經典人氣名物帶到香港！即將於8月中推出XXL巨型尺寸明太子法包，其足足長達33厘米，比一般明太子法包更震撼、更滿足。每個明太子法包均堅持即叫即製，將秘製濃郁明太子醬均勻鋪滿法包表面，再焗至外層香脆、內裡鬆軟有嚼勁的完美口感，令人一試難忘！</p><p>官方IG：@kowloonshangrila 、@bakedbyshangrila</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178634181695789925_18151129546a7969b972692.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178634181889327468_11699670016a7969bb25a0a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178634182035538919_13493238366a7969bcabb1b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178634182185859964_4633620396a7969be20d66.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T06:19:22.698650+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}